    <name>hitorro-fleet-mail-analytics</name>
    <description>
        Spring Boot backend for the mail-analytics fleet member. Talks to
        hitorro-fleet-retrieval for search + facets, hosts durable state
        (JPA), schedules ingest + alerts + reports, delivers alerts via
        email / webhook / in-app inbox. Serves the bundled React SPA from
        classpath:/static/ built by frontend-maven-plugin.
    </description>

